:: Await {"position":"800,1050","size":"100,100"}



:: Creation {"position":"800,400","size":"100,100"}
You are a droid of unknown purpose being built in a room.
There is a group of workers installing your parts.

[[Have your eyes installed first->Eyes]]
[[Have your ears installed first->Ears]]
[[Have your voice-box installed first->Voice]]


:: DroidFreedom {"position":"1075,1825","size":"100,100"}
You have broken free from your restraining bolt and have the freedom to proceed how you wish, unlocking the ability to see all that you have missed.

[[Return to the factory with your new-found freedom->Creation]]


:: Ears {"position":"1025,525","size":"100,100"}
You hear things.

two worker droids talking
vent noises
hum of factory/engine

[[Listen to left->Voice]] 
[[Listen to right->Eyes]] 
[[Listen to vent->Vent]]
[[Await]] 


:: Eyes {"position":"800,525","size":"100,100"}
The workers install the cameras in your head, a spark of electricity runs through your system as you come to life.

As the environment around you becomes visible you can see.

[[Look around->LookAroundCreation]]
[[Look toward worker holding a voice-box->Voice]]
[[Look toward worker holding ears->Ears]]
[[Stay completely motionless->Await]]


:: Forced Assembly Line {"position":"825,0","size":"100,100"}
Due to your complacent behaviour, following orders and lack of violent tendencies, you have been assigned to work in the factory in which you were built, building future droids.

[[Begin the creation of a new droid->Creation]] 


